@startuml
title Delete Site Schedule

start

:Coordinator: Enter site ID and date to add/modify;
:System: Check database to see if an existing schedule for that date exists, returning empty if no schedule exists for that date, or schedule details if it does;
:System: Return 'results' to coordinator;

if (schedule exists) then (no)
    :System: Show message that no schedule exists to delete;
    stop
else (yes)
  :System: Search database for existing blocks and reservations belonging to scheduled date;
  if (Existing reservations) then (yes)
    :System: Show message that schedule cannot be deleted due to existing reservations;
  else (no)
    :System: Show confirmation option;
    if (Coordinator confirms) then (no)
      stop
    else (yes)
      :System: Delete schedule from database;
    endif
  endif
endif

stop

@enduml